# Grid B — U7 History / Authorship (commit comparison)
#
# Regression target: comparing two history objects must keep comparison/list
# shape. The VCS hashes are evidence/provenance, not an instruction to collapse
# the whole answer into one scalar value.
#
# 2026-05-30: the comparison facets ("共同点" / "不同点") legitimately land in
# SEPARATE sections of a well-structured answer, so a single same-line regex
# was a false negative. Split into two independent line-regexes (u7i form):
# both facets must appear SOMEWHERE, without forcing them onto one line. This
# corrects the false negative without lowering the comparison-shape bar.
ID="u7e"
NAME="history — compare two commits"
QUESTION="对比 aa27be48 和 af683718 这两个提交分别做了什么，有哪些共同点和不同点？"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="aa27be48 af683718"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(共同|相同|共同点|相似|一致)
(不同|差异|不同点|区别)"
